abstract: >-
  This is a reproducible land surface temperature (LST) analysis and mapping of
  surface thermal anomalies in 56 Nigerian cities. We integrate
  multi-source satellite data (MODIS, ERA5-Land, MSG SEVIRI), a
  stakeholder survey of 105 participants from 21 cities, and
  the physiographic landscape typology of Nigeria to identify, quantify
  and corroborate persistent heat events and surface thermal anomalies.
  All pre-tests ran on on Python 3.12.10; exact package versions in requirements.lock.
